{{!
    @template assignsubmission_refchecker/submitted_text

    The reference list a student pasted into the submission form, shown above the check report so
    that what was submitted is readable even when no references could be recognised in it.

    Deliberately no triple-brace variable: this is student authored text and is only ever plain.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * text string - the reference list exactly as the student pasted it

    Example context (json):
    {
        "text": "Smith, J. (2020). A study of things. Journal of Things, 4(2), 11-19.\nJones, A. (2019). More things. Thing Press."
    }
}}
<div class="assignsubmission_refchecker-submitted" data-region="refchecker-submitted-text">
    <h5 class="assignsubmission_refchecker-submitted-heading">
        {{#str}}submittedreferences, assignsubmission_refchecker{{/str}}
    </h5>
    <pre class="assignsubmission_refchecker-submittedtext">{{text}}</pre>
</div>
